# English only

This repository is published under the `paymastech` organization. All
content is in English: code comments and doc comments, README and other
docs, commit messages, tags, test names and comments, release notes, and
the UI of example apps.

Exceptions: localization dictionaries (the `ru` entries next to `en`) and
test fixtures recorded by the Secret Keeper app, where non-English strings
are data and stay as they are.

Do not use em dashes or en dashes in prose; use a hyphen, comma, colon, or
rephrase.
